  "description": "Tow Behind Lawn & Garden Broadcast Spreader for Seed Holds up to 130 lbs with 13\" Pneumatic Tires and Adjustable Flow Control Lever,for Fertilizer, Grass Seed, Salt, Ice Melt, Lawn\nFeatures\nHigh-Capacity Durable Hopper‌:Built to tackle big jobs with a 130 lb. capacity, this rust-proof poly construction resists dents and impacts. Cover 15,000 sq ft per load and cut downtime good for seed, fertilizer, ice melt, and more.\nAll-Terrain Heavy-Duty Chassis‌:A reinforced steel frame supports 130lbs, paired with 13\" pneumatic tires that crush rough terrain like gravel, mud, or uneven lawns. Built to haul and spread without wobbling.\nSmartFlow Precision Control System‌:Adjust spread width and density on the fly with 5-speed settings from your seat. The tapered hopper stops clogs, delivering consistent coverage for lawns, fields, or tight garden beds.\nUniversal Quick-Connect Hitch‌:Attach to any tractor, ZTR, ATV, or UTV in seconds with an industrial-grade hitch pin. Easy assemblyparts sorte d by step and guided by color diagrams. Ready to roll in 30 minutes.\nYear Round Versatility‌:Master every season: spring seeding, summer fertilizing, fall lawn prep, and winter de-icing. Military-grade spread patterns maximize material efficiency for any task.",
